    <node id="remaster">
      <data key="d0">remaster</data>
      <data key="d1">tag</data>
      <data key="d2">The Remaster refers to the updated version of Crown Of Brine III: Tides Of Forgetting, including improved textures, water effects, gameplay mechanics, hint system updates, and restored scenes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Remaster refers to an updated version of the game that altered audio cues in the Drowned Market area, affecting subtle music shifts near secret paths.&lt;SEP&gt;Remaster refers to the updated version of Crown of Brine: Reborn that includes improved voice acting and visuals but has incomplete localization in some dialogue trees.&lt;SEP&gt;Forum tag: remaster</data>
