    <node id="game-2">
      <data key="d0">game-2</data>
      <data key="d1">tag</data>
      <data key="d2">Game-2 is the platform or installment featuring the Drowned Market, with trailers containing voice-acting clips and atmospheric scenes influencing fan art and fan fiction.&lt;SEP&gt;Game-2 is the game in which players experience a softlock issue when interacting with the lighthouse hermit during a quest.&lt;SEP&gt;Game-2 is another game affected by the Doubloon SDK's inability to load separate music stems.&lt;SEP&gt;Game-2 is another game project using the Doubloon SDK affected by stem loading problems.&lt;SEP&gt;Forum tag: game-2</data>
