      <data key="d1">user</data>
      <data key="d2">Salty_Cabin-Boy is a community member who stressed the importance of consistent tagging to keep the forum organized and reduce duplicate posts about recurring bugs.&lt;SEP&gt;Salty_Cabin-Boy is a player considering attempting the No-the Spectral Cutlass Challenge on iOS and seeking advice and strategies regarding weapon alternatives and inventory management.&lt;SEP&gt;A player experiencing the same save corruption problem on iOS after decoding the salt-bone amulet, providing temporary workarounds and advice.&lt;SEP&gt;Salty_Cabin-Boy is a community member and fan of Crown Of Brine III: Tides Of Forgetting who shares excitement about the fan event, remaster, gameplay updates, and puzzle-solving experiences.&lt;SEP&gt;Salty_Cabin-Boy is a player character who reports the softlock issue tied to quest order and suggests completing the walkthrough mission before interacting with the lighthouse hermit.&lt;SEP&gt;Salty_Cabin-Boy is a community member impressed by the ethereal glow and mystic embroidery details of the spectral cutlass and is inspired for their own remaster project.&lt;SEP&gt;Salty_Cabin-Boy is a community member who values the haunting solitude depicted in the fan-art and highlights theories about the Hermit's past and hidden mods affecting the lighthouse’s position.&lt;SEP&gt;salty_Cabin-Boy is a user experiencing the same music stem loading issues in the Doubloon SDK, discussing workarounds and expressing frustration over the “won’t-fix” status.&lt;SEP&gt;Forum user: salty_cabin-boy</data>
