      <data key="d2">Voice-Acting from game-2 adds personality and mood to the Drowned Market setting, inspiring fan-fiction storytelling and miniature poses.&lt;SEP&gt;Voice-acting in Chapter 1: Salt and Sorrow is noted for impressive tone shifts and emotional weight enhancing the game atmosphere.&lt;SEP&gt;Forum tag: voice-acting</data>
