    <node id="localization">
      <data key="d0">localization</data>
      <data key="d1">tag</data>
      <data key="d2">Localization involves adapting the game’s dialogue and text into English, which has inconsistencies in Crown of Brine: Reborn with some dialogue trees untranslated.&lt;SEP&gt;Localization involves adapting game content to different languages and regions, emphasizing that it is more than just direct translation and can change the tone and player experience.&lt;SEP&gt;Forum tag: localization</data>
