      <data key="d2">Soggy_Rigger is a community member who emphasized the value of using tags properly to distinguish between original and remastered versions and to keep the forum tidy for all users.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggy_Rigger is a player who has attempted and found the challenge feasible with practice, emphasizing agility upgrades, stamina management, and watching top runners' clips.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggy_Rigger is a community member enthusiastic about the fan event who hopes for insights into lingering mysteries, remaster improvements, and preservation of the game's eerie atmosphere.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggy_Rigger is a community member who praised the fan-art’s portrayal of the Lighthouse Hermit's lair, noting backstory depth and environmental details like the glowing blue lantern.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggy_Rigger is a player character who advises on stealth tactics including using a loose alarm panel, makeshift key, and hidden paths for escaping the brig in game-1.&lt;SEP&gt;Forum user: soggy_rigger</data>
