    <node id="Glitchless Category">
      <data key="d0">Glitchless Category</data>
      <data key="d1">issue</data>
      <data key="d2">The Glitchless Category is a defined speedrun category for the game Crown of Brine that prohibits any use of glitches, duplicate tricks, or unintended game exploits, focusing on intended mechanics and skillful planning.&lt;SEP&gt;Glitchless Category is a speedrun category for Crown of Brine focusing on avoiding all glitches to maintain authentic gameplay and fair competition.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e94205c01e35a57821a39020b87a9301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a13678402573cc3e73bc43b3ea412ac</data>
