    <node id="Classic Mac Build">
      <data key="d0">Classic Mac Build</data>
      <data key="d1">mod</data>
      <data key="d2">The Classic Mac Build is the original version of Crown of Brine, noted for being charming but difficult for verifying glitchless runs.&lt;SEP&gt;The Classic Mac Build is a version of Crown of Brine used in glitchless runs that preserves the original challenge feel and involves specific game mechanics without shortcuts or exploits.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e94205c01e35a57821a39020b87a9301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a13678402573cc3e73bc43b3ea412ac</data>
      <data key="d4">topic-31.json</data>
