    <node id="Crown Of Brine: Reborn">
      <data key="d0">Crown Of Brine: Reborn</data>
      <data key="d1">game</data>
      <data key="d2">Crown Of Brine: Reborn is a modded game with an expanded lore, new walkthroughs, and custom content, including theory crafting and community mods.&lt;SEP&gt;Crown of Brine: Reborn is a remastered game experiencing crashes on Android devices during the lighthouse arc.&lt;SEP&gt;Crown of Brine: Reborn is a game with an active fan community, involving lore and speedrunning elements, featuring ongoing expansions.&lt;SEP&gt;Crown of Brine: Reborn is a remastered game featuring improved voice acting and updated visuals, but contains untranslated dialogue trees affecting immersion in some side quests.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e6646723530317274a426093a223bd40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3295e205feea8d3b15dc68124078cc5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8000c6408e9a72afbe529fdd4da50be5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5d01af907c9787e5a8e8eed592e67de</data>
