    <node id="Scurvy Harpooner">
      <data key="d0">Scurvy Harpooner</data>
      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">Scurvy Harpooner is a community member who actively promotes the fan event and shares enthusiasm about the modded content, lore discussions, and walkthrough strategies for Crown Of Brine: Reborn.&lt;SEP&gt;Scurvy Harpooner is the creator who embroidered the Lost Map and shared insights about the project's challenges and features.&lt;SEP&gt;Scurvy Harpooner is a participant offering advice on interpreting flash counts, pauses, timing, and color distinctions within the lighthouse cipher puzzle.&lt;SEP&gt;Scurvy Harpooner is a player analyzing localization choices for underwater atmosphere, idiomatic expression adaptation, puzzle difficulty, and visual hint adjustments in Chapter 3.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e6646723530317274a426093a223bd40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20b7be9b5d12da156b24257a76041740&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc812cbe5c40ece6d16b6ab1ca27343d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae96fd9a28374f12100f276b1519d9c8</data>
