    </node>
    <node id="Soggy Rigger">
      <data key="d0">Soggy Rigger</data>
      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">Soggy Rigger is a community member looking forward to the fan event, especially interested in lore theories, walkthrough challenges, mod packs, and speedrunning strategies for Crown Of Brine: Reborn.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggy Rigger is a character who praises the painted miniatures’ depiction of the Drowned Market’s soaked and weathered atmosphere and acknowledges the influence on related fan fiction.&lt;SEP&gt;Soggy Rigger is a player discussing challenges in translating underwater puns, cultural references, and voice work affecting text localization in Chapter 3.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e6646723530317274a426093a223bd40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d5fba55f42c843403203cd0057eff7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae96fd9a28374f12100f276b1519d9c8</data>
