    </node>
    <node id="Tideworn Lords">
      <data key="d0">Tideworn Lords</data>
      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">The Tideworn Lords are legendary figures within the lore of Crown Of Brine: Reborn, discussed in theories shared by the community.</data>
