      <data key="d0">Spectral Cutlass</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">The Spectral Cutlass is a go-to weapon favored for its speed and damage, central to gameplay in the Greenwater Bay region and omitted in the No-the Spectral Cutlass Challenge.&lt;SEP&gt;The Spectral Cutlass is an object described with an ethereal glow and a blade aura featuring subtle gradients that give it a ghostly appearance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Spectral Cutlass is a ghostly seas adventure weapon featured in the game and remastered in a modded version with expanded lore.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-17db7f1fd3181db65c0602e11860133e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-976b0b38affc91ce64e175128337fad5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-183aa200ddb20ce576c2f8949ad2edfb</data>
