      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Drowned Market is a game expansion featuring a murky, salty setting with weathered clothes, waterlogged stalls, and ambient voice-acting that brings the underwater environment to life.&lt;SEP&gt;The Drowned Market is a complex level featuring shifting platforms and underwater passages, making navigation difficult and requiring key items to unlock doors.</data>
