    <node id="Voice Acting">
      <data key="d0">Voice Acting</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Voice acting refers to the vocal performance used to characterize figures in the game world, enhancing immersion.&lt;SEP&gt;Voice acting is involved in the softlock bug, where voice lines cut out or loop, causing dialogue progression to halt.&lt;SEP&gt;Voice acting is an aspect of Crown of Brine: Reborn that has been improved in the remaster and is mostly top-notch, contrasting with the untranslated dialogue trees.&lt;SEP&gt;Voice acting in the scene with the disgraced quartermaster is praised but is disrupted by the softlock bug causing looping and freezing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9903495ba67aac5c0a482bac1b66238e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e3000b4af96c385d975af2e2b636806&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5d01af907c9787e5a8e8eed592e67de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a28ded097a2d7c8624ac3f673c2161a</data>
