    <node id="Doubloon SDK">
      <data key="d0">Doubloon SDK</data>
      <data key="d1">mod</data>
      <data key="d2">The Doubloon SDK is a software development kit used in a remaster project that is experiencing issues loading sprites, especially in modded environments and the compass-editor.&lt;SEP&gt;The Doubloon SDK is a modification tool used for loading and managing music stems in games, specifically game-1 and game-2, but it is reported to fail at loading music stems properly.&lt;SEP&gt;The Doubloon SDK is a software development kit used in game projects, which has issues with loading music stems consistently and properly handling stem metadata.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96f190c786ce4257203c3d6b66d025a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85c16fae2334d444c9212b6502181b3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07f4ec6e0ca4202e8d8347800628e9b8</data>
