    </node>
    <node id="Sprites Loading Issue">
      <data key="d0">Sprites Loading Issue</data>
      <data key="d1">issue</data>
      <data key="d2">The sprites loading issue involves sprites failing to appear in the preview or final build within the compass-editor when using the Doubloon SDK, particularly with modded content.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96f190c786ce4257203c3d6b66d025a4</data>
      <data key="d4">topic-14.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1777421626</data>
