    </node>
    <node id="Compass Editor">
      <data key="d0">Compass Editor</data>
      <data key="d1">mod</data>
      <data key="d2">The Compass Editor is a component or feature within the Doubloon SDK used to manage and preview assets such as sprites, which currently has difficulties loading sprites from modded sources.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96f190c786ce4257203c3d6b66d025a4</data>
      <data key="d4">topic-14.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1777421626</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Remaster Project">
      <data key="d0">Remaster Project</data>
      <data key="d1">project</data>
      <data key="d2">The Remaster Project is a development effort related to the Doubloon SDK, involving updates that changed asset pipeline and asset indexing, impacting sprite loading.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96f190c786ce4257203c3d6b66d025a4</data>
      <data key="d4">topic-14.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1777421626</data>
      <data key="d6" />
