    <node id="Modded Version">
      <data key="d0">Modded Version</data>
      <data key="d1">mod</data>
      <data key="d2">A modded version of the Doubloon SDK used by players which may cause conflicts affecting sprite loading in the compass-editor.&lt;SEP&gt;The modded version of Forgotten Lighthouse includes sound routine modifications such as complex layering and uses custom interrupts, which contribute to audio dropouts during gameplay.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96f190c786ce4257203c3d6b66d025a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cb40b7b88f8ddedfd10a5ec14d2e48a</data>
