    <node id="Refresh Assets Command">
      <data key="d0">Refresh Assets Command</data>
      <data key="d1">guide</data>
      <data key="d2">The refresh assets command is a manual action within the compass-editor to rebuild the asset database and temporarily fix the sprite loading issue.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-96f190c786ce4257203c3d6b66d025a4</data>
      <data key="d4">topic-14.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1777421626</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Reload Assets Option">
      <data key="d0">Reload Assets Option</data>
      <data key="d1">guide</data>
      <data key="d2">The reload assets option is a setting in the compass-editor which forces the SDK to rebuild the asset cache to help modded sprites appear again without crashing.</data>
