      <data key="d1">issue</data>
      <data key="d2">Softlock is a bug where the game freezes or becomes unresponsive during interaction with the lighthouse hermit, preventing player actions and progress.&lt;SEP&gt;Softlock is a game-breaking bug causing the game to freeze and become unresponsive during interaction with the disgraced quartermaster, particularly on Windows.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1e3000b4af96c385d975af2e2b636806&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a28ded097a2d7c8624ac3f673c2161a</data>
