      <data key="d0">Lighthouse Hermit</data>
      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">The lighthouse hermit is a character in game-2 who provides a key and is central to a quest that triggers a softlock bug during interaction.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lighthouse Hermit is a mysterious character known for his eerie yet comforting vibe, possibly a former lighthouse keeper who discovered time manipulation secrets, associated with cryptic symbols, mysterious dialogue, and isolation near the Broken Coast.</data>
