    <node id="Lighthouse Cipher">
      <data key="d0">Lighthouse Cipher</data>
      <data key="d1">issue</data>
      <data key="d2">The Lighthouse Cipher is a complex coded message using flashing light patterns, Morse code elements, timing intervals, and environmental clues such as tides and background noises to encode information.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lighthouse Cipher is a puzzle involving light flash patterns, symbols, and colors around a lighthouse that players must decode using timing, sequencing, and environmental clues.</data>
