      <data key="d2">Lucky Cooper is a participant discussing the relationship of lighthouse beam angles, symbols, timing rhythms, and spatial orientation as keys to solving the lighthouse cipher.&lt;SEP&gt;Lucky Cooper is a player who shares insights on localization choices, puzzle design, and environmental storytelling in Chapter 3: Below The Brine.</data>
