    <node id="Expanded Scripting API">
      <data key="d0">Expanded Scripting API</data>
      <data key="d1">mod</data>
      <data key="d2">Expanded Scripting API in the Doubloon SDK Update introduces functions that allow finer control of in-game events, enabling creative narrative branching and dynamic environmental changes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f9c686196637ac63107dfb19abf0492f</data>
      <data key="d4">topic-32.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1777421742</data>
