    <node id="Ambient Occlusion">
      <data key="d0">Ambient Occlusion</data>
      <data key="d1">mod</data>
      <data key="d2">Ambient Occlusion is a lighting technique included in the Doubloon SDK Update that enhances depth and realism by shading creases, holes, and surfaces where light is occluded.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f9c686196637ac63107dfb19abf0492f</data>
