      <data key="d0">Crown Of Brine II: The Phantom Galleon</data>
      <data key="d1">game</data>
      <data key="d2">Crown Of Brine II: The Phantom Galleon is a remastered game featuring music stems, some of which remain untranslated and unlocalized, especially in less prominent areas, impacting story and lore clues.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d3bde729c55ddd1bac32df5200454efc</data>
      <data key="d4">topic-23.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1777421761</data>
