      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Deep-Sea Ballads are musical pieces in Crown Of Brine II: The Phantom Galleon believed to have hidden history and meaning that could enhance world-building if background info was provided.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d3bde729c55ddd1bac32df5200454efc</data>
